    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Gnolls first appeared when hyenas devoured flesh corrupted by the Abyss. Their savagery pleased the demon lord Yeenoghu, who multiplied them and scattered them throughout the multiverse; since then they have served him with cackling glee, wreaking destruction and feeding on whatever is left. Fangs of Yeenoghu are gnolls possessed by fragments of the demon lord’s essence. These zealots steer the frenzy of gnoll packs, hunting for gruesome signs from Yeenoghu and trying to decipher his brutal designs.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
